    <us-gaap:ScheduleOfBusinessAcquisitionsByAcquisitionTextBlock contextRef="c-1" id="f-661">The aggregate purchase price consideration for Moveworks was $2.4&#160;billion, which was comprised of the&#160;following (in millions):&lt;div style="margin-bottom:8pt;margin-top:8pt;text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:85.953%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.841%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:10.806%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="background-color:#032d42;padding:0 1pt"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="6" style="background-color:#032d42;border-left:0.5pt solid #ffffff;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#ffffff;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%"&gt;Fair Value&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e6eaec;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Fair value of common stock issued&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5.85pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;position:relative;top:-3.15pt;vertical-align:baseline"&gt;(1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e6eaec;padding:0 1pt"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#e6eaec;padding:2.62pt 0 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-wei